      "side": 1,
      "message": "So for USB4 active cables with PD gen 3.0 and VDO version \u003e\u003d1.3, we take the USB4 speed from Discover Identity SOP\u0027 B2:0\n\nSo, in situation where an active cable supports USB4 but not tbt, we might have a downgrade - since discover mode SOP\u0027 with intel SVID won\u0027t be present.",
